lass=\"post-content-inner\"><p>Warum professionelle Technik Investition bedeutet \u2013 aber am Ende nicht das Equipment, sondern das Ergebnis und seine Wirkung bezahlt werden.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/article><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_8 et_pb_row et_pb_row_nested et_flex_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_14 et_pb_column et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_12_24 et_flex_column_12_24_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_blog_8 et_pb_blog et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_posts et_pb_module\" title=\"Wie Kunden Fotografen wahrnehmen, wenn Vertrauen pl\u00f6tzlich Budgetfragen weicht: Wert kommunizieren und professionell positioniert bleiben.\" alt=\"Kundensicht auf Fotografen\"><div class=\"et_pb_ajax_pagination_container\"><div class=\"et_pb_blog_posts et_flex_module\"><article class=\"et_pb_post et_pb_post_id_9389 clearfix et_pb_blog_item_8_0 post-9389 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-progress category-t09_l09 tag-progress tag-t09_l09\"><h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"https:\/\/dev.prophotoskills.com\/t09_l09_kunden-blick-wenn-aus-vertrauen-ploetzlich-budget-wird\/\">Kunden Blick<\/a><\/h2><p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"entry-categories\"><a href=\"https:\/\/dev.prophotoskills.com\/category\/progress\/\" rel=\"tag\">PROGRESS<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/dev.prophotoskills.com\/category\/progress\/t09_l09\/\" rel=\"tag\">T09_L09<\/a><\/span><\/p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>Warum Vertrauen allein nicht reicht \u2013 und wie du Budgetgespr\u00e4che professionell f\u00fchrst, ohne Beziehung oder Positionierung zu verlieren.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/article><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_15 et_pb_column et-last-child et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_12_24 et_flex_column_12_24_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_image_3